WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.156
In one cancer context a signalling pathway can favour

00:00:04.156 --> 00:00:07.761
tumour growth. In another it may help restrain it.

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:17.580
SLIT2 binds ROBO receptors through a broad protein

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.734
interface, shaped by cellular location and associated partners.

00:00:28.092 --> 00:00:32.463
We surveyed patent families from twenty twenty through

00:00:32.463 --> 00:00:36.835
twenty twenty-six, examining the proposed intervention and experimental support.

00:00:43.425 --> 00:00:48.288
Antibodies, ligand traps and other strategies promise different forms of

00:00:48.288 --> 00:00:53.151
pathway disruption. Not all claims demonstrate the same level of enablement.

00:01:00.383 --> 00:01:03.693
A useful inhibitor must be matched to the

00:01:03.693 --> 00:01:07.003
tumour biology where the pathway is actually driving disease.

00:01:12.258 --> 00:01:15.701
The question is not simply whether the axis can

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:19.143
be blocked, but when blocking it will make biological sense.
